              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-utils: Plexus-utils: Directory Traversal in extractFile method"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Directory Traversal vulnerability in the extractFile method of org.codehaus.plexus.util.Expand in plexus-utils before 6d780b3378829318ba5c2d29547e0012d5b29642. This allows an attacker to execute arbitrary code"
